WEBVTT

00:28:28.944 --> 00:28:30.739
CA: Ed, can you still hear us?

00:28:30.739 --> 00:28:34.255
ES: Yes, I can hear you.
CA: Oh, he's back.


00:28:34.255 --> 00:28:35.850
TBL: The wiretap on your line

00:28:35.850 --> 00:28:37.756
got a little interfered with for a moment.

00:28:37.756 --> 00:28:39.409
(Laughter)

00:28:39.409 --> 00:28:41.611
ES: It's a little bit of an NSA problem.

00:28:41.611 --> 00:28:45.418
TBL: So, from the 25 years,

00:28:45.418 --> 00:28:48.355
stepping back and thinking,

00:28:48.355 --> 00:28:50.101
what would you think would be

00:28:50.101 --> 00:28:52.708
the best that we could achieve

00:28:52.708 --> 00:28:54.568
from all the discussions that we have

00:28:54.568 --> 00:28:57.461
about the web we want?

00:28:57.461 --> 00:29:00.833
ES: When we think about